{"book":"New Headway Beginner 4th Edition","units":[{"unit":1,"title":"Hello everybody!","topic":"Greetings, introductions, countries","grammar":"am / is / are · I / my · Countries & nationalities","bangla_notes":"এই unit-এ শিখবে: আমি/তুমি/সে পরিচয় দেওয়া। 'I am', 'You are', 'He/She is' — এই তিনটা সবচেয়ে গুরুত্বপূর্ণ। যেমন: 'My name is David.' / 'I'm from England.' / 'She is a teacher.' Hello বলার পর সাধারণত জিজ্ঞেস করে 'How are you?' — উত্তর: 'Fine, thanks!'","tracks":14,"vocabulary":[{"word":"hello","bangla":"হ্যালো","example":"Hello! My name is Sara."},{"word":"name","bangla":"নাম","example":"My name is Ahmed."},{"word":"country","bangla":"দেশ","example":"Which country are you from?"},{"word":"meet","bangla":"দেখা করা","example":"Nice to meet you!"},{"word":"introduce","bangla":"পরিচয় করানো","example":"Let me introduce myself."},{"word":"language","bangla":"ভাষা","example":"English is an important language."},{"word":"teacher","bangla":"শিক্ষক","example":"She is a good teacher."},{"word":"welcome","bangla":"স্বাগতম","example":"Welcome to our class!"},{"word":"school","bangla":"স্কুল","example":"I go to school every day."},{"word":"student","bangla":"ছাত্র/ছাত্রী","example":"He is a good student."},{"word":"friend","bangla":"বন্ধু","example":"She is my best friend."},{"word":"person","bangla":"ব্যক্তি","example":"He is a kind person."},{"word":"people","bangla":"মানুষ","example":"People here are very friendly."},{"word":"man","bangla":"পুরুষ","example":"The man is a doctor."},{"word":"woman","bangla":"মহিলা","example":"The woman is a teacher."},{"word":"city","bangla":"শহর","example":"Dhaka is a big city."},{"word":"world","bangla":"পৃথিবী","example":"English is spoken all over the world."},{"word":"home","bangla":"বাড়ি","example":"I am at home today."},{"word":"nationality","bangla":"জাতীয়তা","example":"What is your nationality?"},{"word":"conversation","bangla":"কথোপকথন","example":"We had a good conversation."},{"word":"question","bangla":"প্রশ্ন","example":"Do you have a question?"},{"word":"answer","bangla":"উত্তর","example":"Please answer the question."},{"word":"vocabulary","bangla":"শব্দভাণ্ডার","example":"Build your vocabulary every day."},{"word":"grammar","bangla":"ব্যাকরণ","example":"Grammar is important in English."},{"word":"pronunciation","bangla":"উচ্চারণ","example":"Work on your pronunciation daily."},{"word":"lesson","bangla":"পাঠ","example":"This is lesson one."},{"word":"class","bangla":"ক্লাস","example":"Our class starts at 9am."},{"word":"course","bangla":"কোর্স","example":"I am doing an English course."},{"word":"practice","bangla":"অনুশীলন","example":"Practice speaking every day."},{"word":"introduction","bangla":"পরিচিতি","example":"Write a short introduction."},{"word":"good","bangla":"ভালো","example":"Good morning! How are you?"},{"word":"nice","bangla":"সুন্দর / চমৎকার","example":"It is nice to meet you."},{"word":"happy","bangla":"খুশি / সুখী","example":"I am happy to be here."},{"word":"new","bangla":"নতুন","example":"This is my new teacher."},{"word":"right","bangla":"সঠিক","example":"That is the right answer."},{"word":"true","bangla":"সত্য","example":"Is that true?"},{"word":"different","bangla":"আলাদা / ভিন্ন","example":"Every country is different."},{"word":"important","bangla":"গুরুত্বপূর্ণ","example":"English is very important."},{"word":"interesting","bangla":"আকর্ষণীয়","example":"This lesson is very interesting."},{"word":"wonderful","bangla":"অসাধারণ","example":"What a wonderful class!"},{"word":"speak","bangla":"কথা বলা","example":"Can you speak English?"},{"word":"learn","bangla":"শেখা","example":"I want to learn English."},{"word":"know","bangla":"জানা","example":"Do you know her name?"},{"word":"understand","bangla":"বোঝা","example":"I don't understand this word."},{"word":"say","bangla":"বলা","example":"How do you say this in English?"},{"word":"tell","bangla":"জানানো","example":"Tell me your name."},{"word":"morning","bangla":"সকাল","example":"Good morning everyone!"},{"word":"day","bangla":"দিন","example":"Have a nice day!"},{"word":"word","bangla":"শব্দ","example":"Learn ten new words every day."},{"word":"age","bangla":"বয়স","example":"What is your age?"}]},{"unit":2,"title":"Your world","topic":"Countries, cities, jobs, numbers 11–30","grammar":"is / are questions · his / her / their · Numbers","bangla_notes":"এই unit-এ শিখবে: প্রশ্ন করা। 'Where are you from?' 'What's your job?' — 'Where' মানে কোথায়, 'What' মানে কী। 'His name is...' (ছেলের জন্য), 'Her name is...' (মেয়ের জন্য)। Numbers: eleven, twelve, thirteen... thirty।","tracks":15,"vocabulary":[{"word":"job","bangla":"চাকরি / পেশা","example":"What is your job?"},{"word":"city","bangla":"শহর","example":"London is a big city."},{"word":"world","bangla":"পৃথিবী","example":"She wants to travel the world."},{"word":"number","bangla":"সংখ্যা","example":"What is your phone number?"},{"word":"age","bangla":"বয়স","example":"He is thirty years old."},{"word":"married","bangla":"বিবাহিত","example":"Are you married?"},{"word":"student","bangla":"ছাত্র/ছাত্রী","example":"She is a university student."},{"word":"question","bangla":"প্রশ্ন","example":"Ask me a question."},{"word":"doctor","bangla":"ডাক্তার","example":"My father is a doctor."},{"word":"nurse","bangla":"নার্স","example":"She works as a nurse."},{"word":"engineer","bangla":"প্রকৌশলী","example":"He is a software engineer."},{"word":"manager","bangla":"ম্যানেজার","example":"She is the office manager."},{"word":"teacher","bangla":"শিক্ষক","example":"He is an English teacher."},{"word":"driver","bangla":"চালক","example":"The bus driver is friendly."},{"word":"worker","bangla":"কর্মী","example":"He is a factory worker."},{"word":"boss","bangla":"বস / কর্তা","example":"My boss is very kind."},{"word":"colleague","bangla":"সহকর্মী","example":"She is my colleague at work."},{"word":"lawyer","bangla":"আইনজীবী","example":"My sister is a lawyer."},{"word":"scientist","bangla":"বিজ্ঞানী","example":"He wants to be a scientist."},{"word":"actor","bangla":"অভিনেতা","example":"He is a famous actor."},{"word":"singer","bangla":"গায়ক/গায়িকা","example":"She is a popular singer."},{"word":"writer","bangla":"লেখক","example":"He is a great writer."},{"word":"artist","bangla":"শিল্পী","example":"She is a talented artist."},{"word":"farmer","bangla":"কৃষক","example":"My uncle is a farmer."},{"word":"police","bangla":"পুলিশ","example":"The police are very helpful."},{"word":"address","bangla":"ঠিকানা","example":"What is your home address?"},{"word":"nationality","bangla":"জাতীয়তা","example":"What is your nationality?"},{"word":"town","bangla":"ছোট শহর","example":"I live in a small town."},{"word":"village","bangla":"গ্রাম","example":"She grew up in a village."},{"word":"north","bangla":"উত্তর","example":"He lives in the north of England."},{"word":"south","bangla":"দক্ষিণ","example":"We drove south for two hours."},{"word":"east","bangla":"পূর্ব","example":"The sun rises in the east."},{"word":"west","bangla":"পশ্চিম","example":"She moved to the west coast."},{"word":"map","bangla":"মানচিত্র","example":"I use a map on my phone."},{"word":"place","bangla":"স্থান","example":"This is a beautiful place."},{"word":"airport","bangla":"বিমানবন্দর","example":"The airport is very busy today."},{"word":"train","bangla":"ট্রেন","example":"I take the train to work."},{"word":"bus","bangla":"বাস","example":"The bus arrives at 8am."},{"word":"speak","bangla":"কথা বলা","example":"Do you speak French?"},{"word":"work","bangla":"কাজ করা","example":"Where do you work?"},{"word":"live","bangla":"বাস করা","example":"Where do you live?"},{"word":"come","bangla":"আসা","example":"Where do you come from?"},{"word":"go","bangla":"যাওয়া","example":"I go to work by bus."},{"word":"know","bangla":"জানা","example":"Do you know this city?"},{"word":"good","bangla":"ভালো","example":"It is good to know you."},{"word":"different","bangla":"আলাদা","example":"Every job is different."},{"word":"important","bangla":"গুরুত্বপূর্ণ","example":"A good job is important."},{"word":"local","bangla":"স্থানীয়","example":"He works at a local school."},{"word":"popular","bangla":"জনপ্রিয়","example":"This job is very popular."},{"word":"famous","bangla":"বিখ্যাত","example":"She is a famous doctor."}]},{"unit":3,"title":"All about you","topic":"Personal information, phone numbers, email","grammar":"am / is / are negative · Questions with what/where/who · Numbers 40–1000","bangla_notes":"এই unit-এ negative শিখবে। 'I am not (I'm not) from London.' 'He isn't a doctor.' — 'isn't' = 'is not'। Personal info দেওয়ার সময় সাধারণ ভুল: 'I am 25 years' বলা ঠিক না, বলতে হবে 'I am 25 years old.'","tracks":11,"vocabulary":[{"word":"phone","bangla":"ফোন","example":"What is your phone number?"},{"word":"email","bangla":"ইমেইল","example":"Please send me an email."},{"word":"address","bangla":"ঠিকানা","example":"What is your home address?"},{"word":"information","bangla":"তথ্য","example":"I need more information."},{"word":"describe","bangla":"বর্ণনা করা","example":"Describe yourself in three words."},{"word":"personal","bangla":"ব্যক্তিগত","example":"This is my personal email."},{"word":"answer","bangla":"উত্তর দেওয়া","example":"Answer all the questions."},{"word":"language","bangla":"ভাষা","example":"How many languages do you speak?"},{"word":"name","bangla":"নাম","example":"What is your full name?"},{"word":"age","bangla":"বয়স","example":"How old are you?"},{"word":"nationality","bangla":"জাতীয়তা","example":"What is your nationality?"},{"word":"married","bangla":"বিবাহিত","example":"Are you married or single?"},{"word":"family","bangla":"পরিবার","example":"Tell me about your family."},{"word":"home","bangla":"বাড়ি","example":"My home is in Dhaka."},{"word":"city","bangla":"শহর","example":"Which city do you live in?"},{"word":"country","bangla":"দেশ","example":"Which country are you from?"},{"word":"number","bangla":"সংখ্যা","example":"Write your number here."},{"word":"date","bangla":"তারিখ","example":"What is today's date?"},{"word":"birthday","bangla":"জন্মদিন","example":"When is your birthday?"},{"word":"year","bangla":"বছর","example":"What year were you born?"},{"word":"correct","bangla":"সঠিক","example":"That answer is correct."},{"word":"mistake","bangla":"ভুল","example":"I made a mistake."},{"word":"true","bangla":"সত্য","example":"Is this information true?"},{"word":"right","bangla":"সঠিক / ঠিক","example":"Are you right?"},{"word":"say","bangla":"বলা","example":"What did you say?"},{"word":"tell","bangla":"জানানো","example":"Tell me your address."},{"word":"ask","bangla":"জিজ্ঞেস করা","example":"Can I ask you a question?"},{"word":"speak","bangla":"কথা বলা","example":"Speak slowly, please."},{"word":"understand","bangla":"বোঝা","example":"I don't understand this."},{"word":"remember","bangla":"মনে রাখা","example":"Remember your password."},{"word":"forget","bangla":"ভুলে যাওয়া","example":"Don't forget your number."},{"word":"know","bangla":"জানা","example":"I don't know his address."},{"word":"learn","bangla":"শেখা","example":"Learn how to spell your name."},{"word":"write","bangla":"লেখা","example":"Write your name here."},{"word":"read","bangla":"পড়া","example":"Read the information carefully."},{"word":"send","bangla":"পাঠানো","example":"Send me an email."},{"word":"receive","bangla":"পাওয়া / গ্রহণ করা","example":"Did you receive my message?"},{"word":"call","bangla":"ফোন করা","example":"Call me tonight."},{"word":"check","bangla":"যাচাই করা","example":"Check your email every day."},{"word":"education","bangla":"শিক্ষা","example":"Education is very important."},{"word":"university","bangla":"বিশ্ববিদ্যালয়","example":"She studies at university."},{"word":"college","bangla":"কলেজ","example":"I go to college."},{"word":"class","bangla":"ক্লাস","example":"My English class is at 10am."},{"word":"course","bangla":"কোর্স","example":"I am doing an IELTS course."},{"word":"experience","bangla":"অভিজ্ঞতা","example":"Do you have work experience?"},{"word":"skill","bangla":"দক্ষতা","example":"Communication is a great skill."},{"word":"knowledge","bangla":"জ্ঞান","example":"Share your knowledge."},{"word":"interest","bangla":"আগ্রহ","example":"What are your interests?"},{"word":"hobby","bangla":"শখ","example":"My hobby is reading."},{"word":"question","bangla":"প্রশ্ন","example":"Answer every question."}]},{"unit":4,"title":"Family and friends","topic":"Family members, possessives, age","grammar":"has / have · Possessive 's · Adjectives","bangla_notes":"এই unit-এ পরিবারের কথা শিখবে। 'She has two children.' — has = আছে (সে/তিনি এর জন্য)। 'David's wife' = David-এর স্ত্রী ('s দিয়ে possession বোঝায়)। Family শব্দ: parents (মা-বাবা), grandparents (দাদা-দাদি), husband/wife, son/daughter।","tracks":17,"vocabulary":[{"word":"family","bangla":"পরিবার","example":"I have a big family."},{"word":"parent","bangla":"মা বা বাবা","example":"My parents are both teachers."},{"word":"child","bangla":"সন্তান / শিশু","example":"They have three children."},{"word":"love","bangla":"ভালোবাসা","example":"I love my family."},{"word":"old","bangla":"বৃদ্ধ / পুরনো","example":"My grandfather is very old."},{"word":"young","bangla":"তরুণ / কম বয়সী","example":"She is very young."},{"word":"married","bangla":"বিবাহিত","example":"My brother is married."},{"word":"husband","bangla":"স্বামী","example":"Her husband is a doctor."},{"word":"wife","bangla":"স্ত্রী","example":"His wife is a teacher."},{"word":"son","bangla":"পুত্র","example":"They have one son."},{"word":"daughter","bangla":"কন্যা","example":"She has two daughters."},{"word":"brother","bangla":"ভাই","example":"My brother lives in London."},{"word":"sister","bangla":"বোন","example":"She has two sisters."},{"word":"grandfather","bangla":"দাদা / নানা","example":"My grandfather is 80 years old."},{"word":"grandmother","bangla":"দাদি / নানি","example":"My grandmother is very kind."},{"word":"uncle","bangla":"চাচা / মামা","example":"My uncle lives abroad."},{"word":"aunt","bangla":"চাচি / মামি","example":"My aunt is a nurse."},{"word":"friend","bangla":"বন্ধু","example":"She is my best friend."},{"word":"neighbour","bangla":"প্রতিবেশী","example":"Our neighbours are very friendly."},{"word":"baby","bangla":"শিশু / বাচ্চা","example":"They have a new baby."},{"word":"adult","bangla":"বয়স্ক ব্যক্তি","example":"This film is for adults only."},{"word":"boy","bangla":"ছেলে","example":"The boy is five years old."},{"word":"girl","bangla":"মেয়ে","example":"The girl plays the piano."},{"word":"man","bangla":"পুরুষ","example":"The man in the photo is my father."},{"word":"woman","bangla":"মহিলা","example":"The woman is my mother."},{"word":"people","bangla":"মানুষ","example":"I like meeting new people."},{"word":"happy","bangla":"সুখী / খুশি","example":"We are a happy family."},{"word":"sad","bangla":"দুঃখী","example":"She was sad when he left."},{"word":"kind","bangla":"দয়ালু","example":"My grandmother is very kind."},{"word":"nice","bangla":"সুন্দর / ভালো","example":"She is a very nice person."},{"word":"funny","bangla":"মজাদার / হাস্যকর","example":"My brother is very funny."},{"word":"serious","bangla":"গম্ভীর","example":"My father is very serious."},{"word":"rich","bangla":"ধনী","example":"He is not very rich."},{"word":"poor","bangla":"গরিব","example":"They were poor but happy."},{"word":"short","bangla":"খাটো / ছোট","example":"My sister is short."},{"word":"good","bangla":"ভালো","example":"She is a good mother."},{"word":"different","bangla":"আলাদা","example":"My brothers are very different."},{"word":"similar","bangla":"একই রকম","example":"We are similar in many ways."},{"word":"special","bangla":"বিশেষ","example":"Family is very special."},{"word":"wonderful","bangla":"চমৎকার","example":"She is a wonderful mother."},{"word":"home","bangla":"বাড়ি","example":"Our home is always full of love."},{"word":"house","bangla":"ঘর / বাড়ি","example":"They have a big house."},{"word":"room","bangla":"কক্ষ / ঘর","example":"I share a room with my brother."},{"word":"garden","bangla":"বাগান","example":"We have a big garden."},{"word":"live","bangla":"বাস করা","example":"We live together as a family."},{"word":"stay","bangla":"থাকা","example":"I always stay close to family."},{"word":"help","bangla":"সাহায্য করা","example":"Family always helps each other."},{"word":"meet","bangla":"দেখা করা","example":"We meet every weekend."},{"word":"great","bangla":"দারুণ / মহান","example":"Family is a great gift."},{"word":"age","bangla":"বয়স","example":"We are the same age."}]},{"unit":5,"title":"The way I live","topic":"Daily routine, work, home life","grammar":"Present Simple he/she/it · Adverbs of frequency","bangla_notes":"এই unit-এ সবচেয়ে গুরুত্বপূর্ণ rule: He/She/It এর সাথে verb-এ 's' লাগে। 'I work' কিন্তু 'She works'. 'I go' কিন্তু 'He goes'. Adverbs: always (সবসময়), usually (সাধারণত), sometimes (মাঝেমাঝে), never (কখনো না)।","tracks":17,"vocabulary":[{"word":"morning","bangla":"সকাল","example":"I wake up every morning at 7."},{"word":"routine","bangla":"নিয়মিত অভ্যাস / রুটিন","example":"My morning routine starts early."},{"word":"breakfast","bangla":"সকালের নাস্তা","example":"I always eat breakfast."},{"word":"always","bangla":"সবসময়","example":"She always drinks coffee."},{"word":"usually","bangla":"সাধারণত","example":"I usually walk to work."},{"word":"sometimes","bangla":"মাঝেমাঝে","example":"I sometimes watch TV at night."},{"word":"never","bangla":"কখনো না","example":"He never eats fast food."},{"word":"work","bangla":"কাজ করা","example":"I work from 9 to 5."},{"word":"afternoon","bangla":"বিকেল","example":"I rest in the afternoon."},{"word":"evening","bangla":"সন্ধ্যা","example":"We eat together in the evening."},{"word":"night","bangla":"রাত","example":"I sleep early at night."},{"word":"hour","bangla":"ঘণ্টা","example":"I work eight hours a day."},{"word":"minute","bangla":"মিনিট","example":"I exercise for 30 minutes."},{"word":"time","bangla":"সময়","example":"What time do you wake up?"},{"word":"day","bangla":"দিন","example":"Every day is the same for me."},{"word":"week","bangla":"সপ্তাহ","example":"I work five days a week."},{"word":"early","bangla":"আগে / সকাল সকাল","example":"I wake up early every day."},{"word":"late","bangla":"দেরি","example":"I never come home late."},{"word":"fast","bangla":"দ্রুত","example":"She eats very fast."},{"word":"slow","bangla":"ধীর","example":"The bus is very slow today."},{"word":"sleep","bangla":"ঘুমানো","example":"I sleep eight hours every night."},{"word":"wake","bangla":"জাগা","example":"I wake up at 6am."},{"word":"eat","bangla":"খাওয়া","example":"We eat together as a family."},{"word":"drink","bangla":"পান করা","example":"I drink water every morning."},{"word":"cook","bangla":"রান্না করা","example":"She cooks dinner every night."},{"word":"walk","bangla":"হাঁটা","example":"I walk to school every day."},{"word":"run","bangla":"দৌড়ানো","example":"He runs every morning."},{"word":"drive","bangla":"গাড়ি চালানো","example":"She drives to work."},{"word":"take","bangla":"নেওয়া","example":"I take the bus to work."},{"word":"go","bangla":"যাওয়া","example":"I go to bed at 10pm."},{"word":"come","bangla":"আসা","example":"I come home at 6pm."},{"word":"start","bangla":"শুরু করা","example":"Work starts at 9am."},{"word":"finish","bangla":"শেষ করা","example":"I finish work at 5pm."},{"word":"stop","bangla":"থামা","example":"The bus stops near my house."},{"word":"home","bangla":"বাড়ি","example":"I stay at home on weekends."},{"word":"office","bangla":"অফিস","example":"I go to the office by bus."},{"word":"school","bangla":"স্কুল","example":"The children go to school."},{"word":"lunch","bangla":"দুপুরের খাবার","example":"I have lunch at 1pm."},{"word":"dinner","bangla":"রাতের খাবার","example":"We eat dinner at 7pm."},{"word":"coffee","bangla":"কফি","example":"I drink coffee every morning."},{"word":"tea","bangla":"চা","example":"Do you want tea or coffee?"},{"word":"regular","bangla":"নিয়মিত","example":"I have regular meals every day."},{"word":"normal","bangla":"স্বাভাবিক","example":"A normal day starts at 7am."},{"word":"busy","bangla":"ব্যস্ত","example":"I am very busy on weekdays."},{"word":"ready","bangla":"প্রস্তুত","example":"I get ready in 20 minutes."},{"word":"clean","bangla":"পরিষ্কার","example":"I clean the house on Sunday."},{"word":"quiet","bangla":"শান্ত","example":"My evenings are quiet and relaxing."},{"word":"comfortable","bangla":"আরামদায়ক","example":"My home is very comfortable."},{"word":"read","bangla":"পড়া","example":"I read before sleeping."},{"word":"like","bangla":"পছন্দ করা","example":"I like my daily routine."}]},{"unit":6,"title":"Every day","topic":"Daily activities, time, days of the week","grammar":"Present Simple questions · do/does · What time...?","bangla_notes":"'Do you like coffee?' — 'do' দিয়ে প্রশ্ন করতে হয়। 'Does she work?' — he/she/it এর জন্য 'does'। 'What time do you wake up?' — সময় জিজ্ঞেস করতে 'What time'। উত্তর: 'I wake up at 7 o'clock.'","tracks":16,"vocabulary":[{"word":"activity","bangla":"কার্যকলাপ","example":"Swimming is my favourite activity."},{"word":"day","bangla":"দিন","example":"What day is it today?"},{"word":"time","bangla":"সময়","example":"What time do you start work?"},{"word":"coffee","bangla":"কফি","example":"Do you want a coffee?"},{"word":"lunch","bangla":"দুপুরের খাবার","example":"I have lunch at 1pm."},{"word":"dinner","bangla":"রাতের খাবার","example":"We eat dinner at 7pm."},{"word":"busy","bangla":"ব্যস্ত","example":"I am very busy on Mondays."},{"word":"listen","bangla":"শোনা","example":"I listen to music every day."},{"word":"week","bangla":"সপ্তাহ","example":"I work five days a week."},{"word":"morning","bangla":"সকাল","example":"I exercise every morning."},{"word":"afternoon","bangla":"বিকেল","example":"What do you do in the afternoon?"},{"word":"evening","bangla":"সন্ধ্যা","example":"I cook dinner in the evening."},{"word":"night","bangla":"রাত","example":"I read books at night."},{"word":"today","bangla":"আজ","example":"What are you doing today?"},{"word":"tomorrow","bangla":"আগামীকাল","example":"I start my new job tomorrow."},{"word":"yesterday","bangla":"গতকাল","example":"What did you do yesterday?"},{"word":"hour","bangla":"ঘণ্টা","example":"I study for two hours every day."},{"word":"minute","bangla":"মিনিট","example":"The bus comes every 15 minutes."},{"word":"start","bangla":"শুরু করা","example":"What time does school start?"},{"word":"finish","bangla":"শেষ করা","example":"What time do you finish work?"},{"word":"exercise","bangla":"ব্যায়াম","example":"I exercise every morning."},{"word":"sport","bangla":"খেলাধুলা","example":"Do you play any sport?"},{"word":"game","bangla":"খেলা","example":"We play a game after school."},{"word":"music","bangla":"সঙ্গীত","example":"I listen to music on the bus."},{"word":"television","bangla":"টেলিভিশন","example":"I watch television after dinner."},{"word":"radio","bangla":"রেডিও","example":"I listen to the radio every morning."},{"word":"computer","bangla":"কম্পিউটার","example":"I use a computer at work."},{"word":"read","bangla":"পড়া","example":"I read the news every morning."},{"word":"write","bangla":"লেখা","example":"I write in my diary at night."},{"word":"look","bangla":"দেখা / তাকানো","example":"Look at this photo."},{"word":"cook","bangla":"রান্না করা","example":"I cook dinner every evening."},{"word":"eat","bangla":"খাওয়া","example":"I eat breakfast at 8am."},{"word":"drink","bangla":"পান করা","example":"I drink two cups of coffee a day."},{"word":"walk","bangla":"হাঁটা","example":"I walk for 30 minutes every day."},{"word":"run","bangla":"দৌড়ানো","example":"He runs in the park every morning."},{"word":"play","bangla":"খেলা","example":"The children play football."},{"word":"dance","bangla":"নাচা","example":"She dances every Saturday."},{"word":"sing","bangla":"গান করা","example":"I sing in the shower!"},{"word":"swim","bangla":"সাঁতার কাটা","example":"I swim twice a week."},{"word":"sleep","bangla":"ঘুমানো","example":"I sleep at 10pm every night."},{"word":"wake","bangla":"জাগা","example":"What time do you wake up?"},{"word":"go","bangla":"যাওয়া","example":"Do you go to the gym?"},{"word":"come","bangla":"আসা","example":"What time do you come home?"},{"word":"take","bangla":"নেওয়া","example":"I take the bus every morning."},{"word":"like","bangla":"পছন্দ করা","example":"Do you like cooking?"},{"word":"want","bangla":"চাওয়া","example":"What do you want to do today?"},{"word":"need","bangla":"দরকার","example":"I need to sleep more."},{"word":"think","bangla":"চিন্তা করা","example":"I think about work all day."},{"word":"feel","bangla":"অনুভব করা","example":"How do you feel today?"},{"word":"know","bangla":"জানা","example":"Do you know what time it is?"}]},{"unit":7,"title":"Places I like","topic":"Places in a town, directions, prepositions","grammar":"there is / there are · Prepositions of place · a/an/the","bangla_notes":"'There is a bank near here.' — There is = আছে (একটা)। 'There are three restaurants.' — There are = আছে (একের বেশি)। Prepositions: in (ভেতরে), on (উপরে), next to (পাশে), opposite (সামনে), between (মাঝে)। a/an = অনির্দিষ্ট, the = নির্দিষ্ট।","tracks":10,"vocabulary":[{"word":"bank","bangla":"ব্যাংক","example":"Is there a bank near here?"},{"word":"restaurant","bangla":"রেস্তোরাঁ","example":"This is a very good restaurant."},{"word":"hotel","bangla":"হোটেল","example":"We stayed in a nice hotel."},{"word":"shop","bangla":"দোকান","example":"The shop opens at 9am."},{"word":"street","bangla":"রাস্তা / সড়ক","example":"She lives on a quiet street."},{"word":"near","bangla":"কাছে","example":"The school is near my house."},{"word":"direction","bangla":"দিকনির্দেশনা","example":"Can you give me directions?"},{"word":"map","bangla":"মানচিত্র","example":"I use a map on my phone."},{"word":"road","bangla":"রাস্তা","example":"The road to the park is long."},{"word":"town","bangla":"শহর / নগর","example":"This is the oldest part of town."},{"word":"city","bangla":"শহর","example":"It is a beautiful city."},{"word":"village","bangla":"গ্রাম","example":"I grew up in a small village."},{"word":"park","bangla":"পার্ক","example":"There is a beautiful park near here."},{"word":"market","bangla":"বাজার","example":"I buy vegetables at the market."},{"word":"supermarket","bangla":"সুপারমার্কেট","example":"The supermarket is open 24 hours."},{"word":"cinema","bangla":"সিনেমা হল","example":"There is a cinema in the centre."},{"word":"theatre","bangla":"থিয়েটার","example":"The theatre is in the city centre."},{"word":"museum","bangla":"জাদুঘর / মিউজিয়াম","example":"Let us visit the museum today."},{"word":"library","bangla":"লাইব্রেরি / পাঠাগার","example":"The library is near the school."},{"word":"church","bangla":"গির্জা / চার্চ","example":"There is a church on the corner."},{"word":"hospital","bangla":"হাসপাতাল","example":"The hospital is very large."},{"word":"school","bangla":"স্কুল","example":"The school is next to the park."},{"word":"university","bangla":"বিশ্ববিদ্যালয়","example":"The university is in the city centre."},{"word":"airport","bangla":"বিমানবন্দর","example":"The airport is outside the city."},{"word":"station","bangla":"স্টেশন","example":"The bus station is on the main road."},{"word":"bus","bangla":"বাস","example":"Take bus number 7 to the centre."},{"word":"train","bangla":"ট্রেন","example":"The train station is nearby."},{"word":"taxi","bangla":"ট্যাক্সি","example":"Take a taxi from the airport."},{"word":"car","bangla":"গাড়ি","example":"I came by car."},{"word":"bike","bangla":"সাইকেল","example":"He rides a bike to work."},{"word":"place","bangla":"স্থান","example":"This is a great place to visit."},{"word":"north","bangla":"উত্তর","example":"Go north for two kilometres."},{"word":"south","bangla":"দক্ষিণ","example":"The park is south of the city."},{"word":"east","bangla":"পূর্ব","example":"The market is in the east."},{"word":"west","bangla":"পশ্চিম","example":"Walk west for five minutes."},{"word":"front","bangla":"সামনে","example":"The shop is in front of the school."},{"word":"back","bangla":"পিছনে","example":"The garden is at the back."},{"word":"right","bangla":"ডানদিকে","example":"Turn right at the corner."},{"word":"open","bangla":"খোলা","example":"The market is open every day."},{"word":"local","bangla":"স্থানীয়","example":"I shop at the local market."},{"word":"public","bangla":"সর্বসাধারণের","example":"There is a public park here."},{"word":"main","bangla":"প্রধান","example":"The bank is on the main road."},{"word":"central","bangla":"কেন্দ্রীয়","example":"We stayed in a central hotel."},{"word":"beautiful","bangla":"সুন্দর","example":"This is a beautiful neighbourhood."},{"word":"interesting","bangla":"আকর্ষণীয়","example":"The museum is very interesting."},{"word":"comfortable","bangla":"আরামদায়ক","example":"The hotel is very comfortable."},{"word":"popular","bangla":"জনপ্রিয়","example":"This restaurant is very popular."},{"word":"find","bangla":"খুঁজে পাওয়া","example":"Can you find the bank on the map?"},{"word":"walk","bangla":"হাঁটা","example":"Walk straight ahead."},{"word":"bridge","bangla":"সেতু / ব্রিজ","example":"Cross the bridge and turn right."}]},{"unit":8,"title":"The world of work","topic":"Jobs, workplaces, working conditions","grammar":"Present Simple review · can/can't for ability","bangla_notes":"'Can you speak English?' — can দিয়ে ability (পারা) বোঝায়। 'I can swim but I can't drive.' — can't = cannot। Can-এর সাথে verb-এর base form লাগে: 'She can speak' (speaks না)। Work-related: salary (বেতন), hours (ঘণ্টা), holiday (ছুটি)।","tracks":12,"vocabulary":[{"word":"salary","bangla":"বেতন","example":"He earns a good salary."},{"word":"ability","bangla":"ক্ষমতা / দক্ষতা","example":"She has the ability to speak French."},{"word":"skill","bangla":"দক্ষতা / পটুতা","example":"Reading is an important skill."},{"word":"manage","bangla":"পরিচালনা করা","example":"She manages a team of ten people."},{"word":"office","bangla":"অফিস","example":"I work in a big office."},{"word":"earn","bangla":"আয় করা","example":"How much do you earn?"},{"word":"company","bangla":"কোম্পানি","example":"She works for a big company."},{"word":"speak","bangla":"কথা বলা","example":"Can you speak English?"},{"word":"work","bangla":"কাজ","example":"Do you enjoy your work?"},{"word":"job","bangla":"চাকরি","example":"I have a good job."},{"word":"boss","bangla":"বস / কর্তা","example":"My boss is very fair."},{"word":"colleague","bangla":"সহকর্মী","example":"I like my colleagues."},{"word":"manager","bangla":"ম্যানেজার","example":"The manager is very strict."},{"word":"director","bangla":"পরিচালক","example":"She is the company director."},{"word":"employee","bangla":"কর্মচারী","example":"The company has 200 employees."},{"word":"worker","bangla":"শ্রমিক / কর্মী","example":"All workers get a holiday."},{"word":"doctor","bangla":"ডাক্তার","example":"She wants to be a doctor."},{"word":"nurse","bangla":"নার্স","example":"Nurses work very long hours."},{"word":"engineer","bangla":"প্রকৌশলী","example":"He is a civil engineer."},{"word":"lawyer","bangla":"আইনজীবী","example":"She is a successful lawyer."},{"word":"scientist","bangla":"বিজ্ঞানী","example":"The scientist made a discovery."},{"word":"driver","bangla":"চালক","example":"He works as a taxi driver."},{"word":"secretary","bangla":"সেক্রেটারি","example":"The secretary answers all calls."},{"word":"member","bangla":"সদস্য","example":"He is a member of the team."},{"word":"leader","bangla":"নেতা","example":"She is a great team leader."},{"word":"expert","bangla":"বিশেষজ্ঞ","example":"He is an expert in computers."},{"word":"experience","bangla":"অভিজ্ঞতা","example":"Do you have work experience?"},{"word":"knowledge","bangla":"জ্ঞান","example":"She has great knowledge of law."},{"word":"education","bangla":"শিক্ষা","example":"Good education helps you get a job."},{"word":"practice","bangla":"অনুশীলন","example":"Practice makes perfect."},{"word":"result","bangla":"ফলাফল","example":"The result of hard work is success."},{"word":"goal","bangla":"লক্ষ্য","example":"My goal is to get a promotion."},{"word":"money","bangla":"টাকা / অর্থ","example":"I need money to pay the rent."},{"word":"pay","bangla":"পরিশোধ করা","example":"They pay me every month."},{"word":"cost","bangla":"খরচ","example":"The course costs a lot of money."},{"word":"rich","bangla":"ধনী","example":"He became rich from his business."},{"word":"poor","bangla":"গরিব","example":"Many workers are very poor."},{"word":"important","bangla":"গুরুত্বপূর্ণ","example":"A good education is important."},{"word":"necessary","bangla":"প্রয়োজনীয়","example":"Experience is necessary for this job."},{"word":"possible","bangla":"সম্ভব","example":"It is possible to find a good job."},{"word":"difficult","bangla":"কঠিন","example":"The job interview was difficult."},{"word":"easy","bangla":"সহজ","example":"The work is not easy."},{"word":"hard","bangla":"কঠিন / পরিশ্রমী","example":"She is a very hard worker."},{"word":"serious","bangla":"গুরুতর / গম্ভীর","example":"He is very serious about his work."},{"word":"right","bangla":"সঠিক","example":"Make the right career choice."},{"word":"complete","bangla":"সম্পূর্ণ করা","example":"Complete the work by Friday."},{"word":"choose","bangla":"বেছে নেওয়া","example":"Choose a job you enjoy."},{"word":"learn","bangla":"শেখা","example":"I learn something new every day."},{"word":"teach","bangla":"শেখানো","example":"She teaches English at a school."},{"word":"help","bangla":"সাহায্য করা","example":"Good colleagues always help each other."}]},{"unit":9,"title":"Times past","topic":"Historical figures, past events, dates","grammar":"Past Simple was/were · Time expressions · Years & dates","bangla_notes":"এই unit-এ past শিখবে। 'He was born in 1990.' — was = ছিল (I/he/she/it)। 'They were students.' — were = ছিল (you/we/they)। Negative: 'It wasn't (was not) easy.' Question: 'Was he famous?' — 'Yes, he was.' / 'No, he wasn't.'","tracks":18,"vocabulary":[{"word":"history","bangla":"ইতিহাস","example":"I love studying history."},{"word":