ulture","bangla":"সংস্কৃতি","example":"She studied local culture."},{"word":"tradition","bangla":"ঐতিহ্য","example":"It is an old tradition."},{"word":"religion","bangla":"ধর্ম","example":"Religion was important then."},{"word":"politics","bangla":"রাজনীতি","example":"He was interested in politics."},{"word":"economy","bangla":"অর্থনীতি","example":"The economy was very weak."},{"word":"science","bangla":"বিজ্ঞান","example":"Science changed the world."},{"word":"art","bangla":"শিল্পকলা","example":"She had a great love of art."},{"word":"literature","bangla":"সাহিত্য","example":"He studied English literature."},{"word":"education","bangla":"শিক্ষা","example":"Education was not free then."},{"word":"important","bangla":"গুরুত্বপূর্ণ","example":"He was an important figure."},{"word":"great","bangla":"মহান","example":"She was a great scientist."},{"word":"major","bangla":"বড় / প্রধান","example":"It was a major historical event."},{"word":"ancient","bangla":"প্রাচীন","example":"The ancient city is now a museum."},{"word":"modern","bangla":"আধুনিক","example":"Modern history is fascinating."},{"word":"true","bangla":"সত্য","example":"Is this story true?"},{"word":"real","bangla":"বাস্তব / সত্যিকারের","example":"He was a real hero."},{"word":"different","bangla":"ভিন্ন","example":"Life was very different 100 years ago."},{"word":"interesting","bangla":"আকর্ষণীয়","example":"History is very interesting."},{"word":"know","bangla":"জানা","example":"What do you know about this person?"},{"word":"read","bangla":"পড়া","example":"I read about this in a book."},{"word":"learn","bangla":"শেখা","example":"We can learn from the past."},{"word":"remember","bangla":"মনে রাখা","example":"Remember this important date."},{"word":"understand","bangla":"বোঝা","example":"It is important to understand history."}]},{"unit":10,"title":"What happened?","topic":"Past events, stories, biographies","grammar":"Past Simple regular & irregular verbs · ago","bangla_notes":"Regular verbs past: ed যোগ করো — work→worked, live→lived, study→studied। Irregular verbs (মুখস্থ করতে হবে): go→went, come→came, see→saw, eat→ate, buy→bought, meet→met। 'I went to school two years ago.' — ago মানে আগে।","tracks":11,"vocabulary":[{"word":"happen","bangla":"ঘটা","example":"What happened yesterday?"},{"word":"travel","bangla":"ভ্রমণ করা","example":"She travelled to ten countries."},{"word":"meet","bangla":"দেখা করা","example":"We met at a conference."},{"word":"story","bangla":"গল্প / কাহিনী","example":"Tell me your story."},{"word":"buy","bangla":"কেনা","example":"I bought a new book yesterday."},{"word":"change","bangla":"পরিবর্তন হওয়া","example":"Everything has changed."},{"word":"ago","bangla":"আগে (সময়ের)","example":"She left two years ago."},{"word":"pay","bangla":"পরিশোধ করা","example":"How much did you pay?"},{"word":"go","bangla":"যাওয়া","example":"Where did you go last weekend?"},{"word":"come","bangla":"আসা","example":"He came home very late."},{"word":"see","bangla":"দেখা","example":"I saw a great film last night."},{"word":"hear","bangla":"শোনা","example":"Did you hear the news?"},{"word":"find","bangla":"খুঁজে পাওয়া","example":"I found my keys under the chair."},{"word":"get","bangla":"পাওয়া","example":"She got a new job last week."},{"word":"give","bangla":"দেওয়া","example":"He gave me a birthday gift."},{"word":"take","bangla":"নেওয়া","example":"I took the bus to work."},{"word":"make","bangla":"তৈরি করা","example":"She made a delicious cake."},{"word":"bring","bangla":"নিয়ে আসা","example":"He brought flowers to the party."},{"word":"move","bangla":"সরা / চলে যাওয়া","example":"She moved to a new city."},{"word":"run","bangla":"দৌড়ানো","example":"He ran very fast."},{"word":"walk","bangla":"হাঁটা","example":"We walked for three hours."},{"word":"eat","bangla":"খাওয়া","example":"We ate at a great restaurant."},{"word":"drink","bangla":"পান করা","example":"She drank too much coffee."},{"word":"sleep","bangla":"ঘুমানো","example":"I slept for ten hours."},{"word":"speak","bangla":"বলা","example":"He spoke to the manager."},{"word":"say","bangla":"বলা","example":"What did she say?"},{"word":"tell","bangla":"জানানো","example":"He told me an interesting story."},{"word":"ask","bangla":"জিজ্ঞেস করা","example":"She asked me many questions."},{"word":"show","bangla":"দেখানো","example":"He showed me his new phone."},{"word":"start","bangla":"শুরু করা","example":"They started a new business."},{"word":"finish","bangla":"শেষ করা","example":"She finished the project on time."},{"word":"stop","bangla":"থামা","example":"The rain stopped in the afternoon."},{"word":"break","bangla":"ভাঙা","example":"He broke his leg."},{"word":"build","bangla":"তৈরি করা","example":"They built a new school."},{"word":"write","bangla":"লেখা","example":"She wrote a famous novel."},{"word":"read","bangla":"পড়া","example":"I read a great book last week."},{"word":"learn","bangla":"শেখা","example":"I learned a lot from that experience."},{"word":"teach","bangla":"শেখানো","example":"She taught English for 20 years."},{"word":"send","bangla":"পাঠানো","example":"She sent me a long email."},{"word":"receive","bangla":"পাওয়া","example":"I received a letter from him."},{"word":"call","bangla":"ফোন করা","example":"He called me yesterday."},{"word":"choose","bangla":"বেছে নেওয়া","example":"She chose a difficult career."},{"word":"decide","bangla":"সিদ্ধান্ত নেওয়া","example":"He decided to study abroad."},{"word":"remember","bangla":"মনে রাখা","example":"Do you remember that day?"},{"word":"forget","bangla":"ভুলে যাওয়া","example":"I forgot my umbrella."},{"word":"understand","bangla":"বোঝা","example":"I finally understood the answer."},{"word":"explain","bangla":"ব্যাখ্যা করা","example":"He explained the problem clearly."},{"word":"describe","bangla":"বর্ণনা করা","example":"Describe what you saw."},{"word":"agree","bangla":"একমত হওয়া","example":"We all agreed on the plan."},{"word":"try","bangla":"চেষ্টা করা","example":"She tried very hard."}]},{"unit":11,"title":"The best in the world!","topic":"Comparing things, world records","grammar":"Comparative & superlative adjectives · than","bangla_notes":"Comparative (তুলনা): big→bigger, expensive→more expensive। 'London is bigger than Paris.' Superlative (সবচেয়ে): big→the biggest, expensive→the most expensive। 'It's the most expensive restaurant in the city.' Irregular: good→better→the best, bad→worse→the worst।","tracks":11,"vocabulary":[{"word":"beautiful","bangla":"সুন্দর","example":"Paris is a beautiful city."},{"word":"expensive","bangla":"দামী / ব্যয়বহুল","example":"This restaurant is very expensive."},{"word":"cheap","bangla":"সস্তা","example":"This market has very cheap food."},{"word":"modern","bangla":"আধুনিক","example":"It is a very modern building."},{"word":"ancient","bangla":"প্রাচীন","example":"This is an ancient temple."},{"word":"compare","bangla":"তুলনা করা","example":"Compare the two prices."},{"word":"record","bangla":"রেকর্ড","example":"She broke the world record."},{"word":"win","bangla":"জেতা","example":"Did your team win?"},{"word":"big","bangla":"বড়","example":"This is the biggest city in the world."},{"word":"long","bangla":"লম্বা / দীর্ঘ","example":"The Amazon is the longest river."},{"word":"short","bangla":"খাটো / ছোট","example":"She is shorter than her sister."},{"word":"high","bangla":"উঁচু / বেশি","example":"Everest is the highest mountain."},{"word":"low","bangla":"নিচু / কম","example":"The temperature is very low today."},{"word":"good","bangla":"ভালো","example":"This is the best restaurant in town."},{"word":"bad","bangla":"খারাপ","example":"That was the worst film I ever saw."},{"word":"fast","bangla":"দ্রুত","example":"This is the fastest train in the world."},{"word":"slow","bangla":"ধীর","example":"This is slower than the other bus."},{"word":"hot","bangla":"গরম","example":"The Sahara is the hottest desert."},{"word":"cold","bangla":"ঠান্ডা","example":"Antarctica is the coldest place."},{"word":"dark","bangla":"অন্ধকার","example":"This room is darker than that one."},{"word":"light","bangla":"হালকা / আলোকিত","example":"This bag is lighter than that one."},{"word":"hard","bangla":"কঠিন","example":"This is harder than I thought."},{"word":"easy","bangla":"সহজ","example":"This exam is easier than last year."},{"word":"rich","bangla":"ধনী","example":"He is one of the richest men."},{"word":"poor","bangla":"গরিব","example":"This is one of the poorest areas."},{"word":"new","bangla":"নতুন","example":"This is the newest model."},{"word":"old","bangla":"পুরনো","example":"This is the oldest bridge in Europe."},{"word":"great","bangla":"দারুণ / মহান","example":"This is one of the greatest cities."},{"word":"perfect","bangla":"নিখুঁত","example":"This is the perfect location."},{"word":"wonderful","bangla":"চমৎকার","example":"What a wonderful place!"},{"word":"interesting","bangla":"আকর্ষণীয়","example":"This is more interesting than that."},{"word":"popular","bangla":"জনপ্রিয়","example":"This is the most popular restaurant."},{"word":"important","bangla":"গুরুত্বপূর্ণ","example":"This is more important than that."},{"word":"difficult","bangla":"কঠিন","example":"This course is more difficult."},{"word":"comfortable","bangla":"আরামদায়ক","example":"This seat is more comfortable."},{"word":"natural","bangla":"প্রাকৃতিক","example":"This is the most natural habitat."},{"word":"world","bangla":"পৃথিবী","example":"What is the tallest building in the world?"},{"word":"country","bangla":"দেশ","example":"Which country is the biggest?"},{"word":"city","bangla":"শহর","example":"What is the most expensive city?"},{"word":"place","bangla":"স্থান","example":"This is the most beautiful place."},{"word":"bridge","bangla":"সেতু","example":"This is the longest bridge."},{"word":"sport","bangla":"খেলাধুলা","example":"Football is the most popular sport."},{"word":"game","bangla":"খেলা","example":"This game is more exciting."},{"word":"player","bangla":"খেলোয়াড়","example":"He is the best player in the world."},{"word":"hero","bangla":"বীর / নায়ক","example":"He is my hero."},{"word":"science","bangla":"বিজ্ঞান","example":"Science is more important than ever."},{"word":"technology","bangla":"প্রযুক্তি","example":"New technology is very expensive."},{"word":"choose","bangla":"বেছে নেওয়া","example":"Which one do you choose?"},{"word":"think","bangla":"মনে করা","example":"I think this is the best option."},{"word":"agree","bangla":"একমত হওয়া","example":"Do you agree that this is better?"}]},{"unit":12,"title":"Thank you very much!","topic":"Food, drinks, restaurants, shopping","grammar":"would like · some/any · How much/many?","bangla_notes":"'I would like a coffee, please.' — would like = চাই (polite)। 'I want' বললেও বোঝা যায় কিন্তু 'would like' বেশি polite। Some/Any: 'I have some money.' (positive), 'I don't have any money.' (negative)। 'How much is it?' — দাম জিজ্ঞেস করতে।","tracks":10,"vocabulary":[{"word":"food","bangla":"খাবার","example":"I love spicy food."},{"word":"drink","bangla":"পানীয় / পান করা","example":"What would you like to drink?"},{"word":"menu","bangla":"মেনু","example":"Can I see the menu, please?"},{"word":"meal","bangla":"খাবার / ভোজন","example":"We had a lovely meal together."},{"word":"pay","bangla":"পরিশোধ করা","example":"Can I pay by card?"},{"word":"enjoy","bangla":"উপভোগ করা","example":"I enjoy trying new food."},{"word":"coffee","bangla":"কফি","example":"I would like a coffee, please."},{"word":"restaurant","bangla":"রেস্তোরাঁ","example":"This is the best restaurant in town."},{"word":"tea","bangla":"চা","example":"Would you like tea or coffee?"},{"word":"water","bangla":"পানি","example":"A glass of water, please."},{"word":"milk","bangla":"দুধ","example":"Do you take milk in your tea?"},{"word":"bread","bangla":"রুটি / পাউরুটি","example":"I have bread for breakfast."},{"word":"rice","bangla":"ভাত / চাল","example":"I eat rice every day."},{"word":"fish","bangla":"মাছ","example":"I love eating fish."},{"word":"meat","bangla":"মাংস","example":"He does not eat meat."},{"word":"fruit","bangla":"ফল","example":"Eat more fruit every day."},{"word":"vegetable","bangla":"সবজি","example":"Fresh vegetables are healthy."},{"word":"sugar","bangla":"চিনি","example":"Do you take sugar in your coffee?"},{"word":"salt","bangla":"লবণ","example":"Add a little salt to the food."},{"word":"oil","bangla":"তেল","example":"Cook the onion in oil."},{"word":"breakfast","bangla":"সকালের নাস্তা","example":"I always eat a big breakfast."},{"word":"lunch","bangla":"দুপুরের খাবার","example":"Let us have lunch together."},{"word":"dinner","bangla":"রাতের খাবার","example":"Dinner is at 7pm."},{"word":"order","bangla":"অর্ডার দেওয়া","example":"Are you ready to order?"},{"word":"bill","bangla":"বিল","example":"Can I have the bill, please?"},{"word":"price","bangla":"দাম / মূল্য","example":"What is the price of this?"},{"word":"cost","bangla":"খরচ","example":"How much does this cost?"},{"word":"money","bangla":"টাকা / অর্থ","example":"Do you have enough money?"},{"word":"card","bangla":"কার্ড","example":"Can I pay by card?"},{"word":"table","bangla":"টেবিল","example":"A table for two, please."},{"word":"chair","bangla":"চেয়ার","example":"Please take a chair."},{"word":"waiter","bangla":"ওয়েটার","example":"The waiter brought the menu."},{"word":"cook","bangla":"রান্না করা","example":"I like to cook at home."},{"word":"customer","bangla":"গ্রাহক","example":"The customer ordered fish."},{"word":"eat","bangla":"খাওয়া","example":"What would you like to eat?"},{"word":"make","bangla":"তৈরি করা","example":"I made a cake for dinner."},{"word":"buy","bangla":"কেনা","example":"I buy vegetables at the market."},{"word":"like","bangla":"পছন্দ করা","example":"Do you like spicy food?"},{"word":"want","bangla":"চাওয়া","example":"What do you want to eat?"},{"word":"need","bangla":"দরকার","example":"I need more sugar."},{"word":"hot","bangla":"গরম","example":"The soup is very hot."},{"word":"cold","bangla":"ঠান্ডা","example":"I want a cold drink."},{"word":"good","bangla":"ভালো","example":"The food here is very good."},{"word":"bad","bangla":"খারাপ","example":"The service was bad today."},{"word":"wonderful","bangla":"অসাধারণ","example":"This meal is wonderful!"},{"word":"nice","bangla":"সুন্দর / চমৎকার","example":"This is a very nice restaurant."},{"word":"new","bangla":"নতুন","example":"I want to try new food."},{"word":"market","bangla":"বাজার","example":"I bought this at the market."},{"word":"shop","bangla":"দোকান","example":"There is a cake shop nearby."},{"word":"special","bangla":"বিশেষ","example":"What is the special today?"}]},{"unit":13,"title":"Here and now","topic":"Current activities, temporary situations","grammar":"Present Continuous · Present Simple vs Continuous","bangla_notes":"Present Continuous মানে এখন চলছে এমন কাজ। 'I am studying.' = আমি এখন পড়ছি। Rule: am/is/are + verb+ing। 'She is watching TV right now.' Present Simple vs Continuous: 'I usually watch TV' (habit) vs 'I am watching TV now' (এখন)।","tracks":12,"vocabulary":[{"word":"currently","bangla":"বর্তমানে / এখন","example":"I am currently working in Dhaka."},{"word":"moment","bangla":"মুহূর্ত","example":"I am busy at the moment."},{"word":"activity","bangla":"কার্যকলাপ","example":"What activity are you doing now?"},{"word":"busy","bangla":"ব্যস্ত","example":"Sorry, I am busy right now."},{"word":"change","bangla":"পরিবর্তন হচ্ছে","example":"Everything is changing so fast."},{"word":"news","bangla":"সংবাদ / খবর","example":"Did you hear the news?"},{"word":"weather","bangla":"আবহাওয়া","example":"The weather is very nice today."},{"word":"phone","bangla":"ফোন করা","example":"She is talking on her phone."},{"word":"work","bangla":"কাজ","example":"I am working from home today."},{"word":"study","bangla":"পড়াশোনা করা","example":"She is studying for her exam."},{"word":"learn","bangla":"শেখা","example":"I am learning English right now."},{"word":"read","bangla":"পড়া","example":"He is reading a book."},{"word":"write","bangla":"লেখা","example":"She is writing an email."},{"word":"listen","bangla":"শোনা","example":"I am listening to music."},{"word":"look","bangla":"দেখা","example":"He is looking out of the window."},{"word":"eat","bangla":"খাওয়া","example":"They are eating lunch."},{"word":"drink","bangla":"পান করা","example":"She is drinking coffee."},{"word":"cook","bangla":"রান্না করা","example":"She is cooking dinner."},{"word":"play","bangla":"খেলা","example":"The children are playing outside."},{"word":"run","bangla":"দৌড়ানো","example":"He is running in the park."},{"word":"walk","bangla":"হাঁটা","example":"She is walking to the station."},{"word":"talk","bangla":"কথা বলা","example":"They are talking about work."},{"word":"speak","bangla":"বলা","example":"She is speaking to the manager."},{"word":"say","bangla":"বলা","example":"What are you saying?"},{"word":"think","bangla":"চিন্তা করা","example":"I am thinking about my plans."},{"word":"feel","bangla":"অনুভব করা","example":"How are you feeling today?"},{"word":"know","bangla":"জানা","example":"Do you know what is happening?"},{"word":"understand","bangla":"বোঝা","example":"I am not understanding this."},{"word":"use","bangla":"ব্যবহার করা","example":"She is using the computer."},{"word":"computer","bangla":"কম্পিউটার","example":"He is working on his computer."},{"word":"television","bangla":"টেলিভিশন","example":"The children are watching television."},{"word":"radio","bangla":"রেডিও","example":"She is listening to the radio."},{"word":"music","bangla":"সঙ্গীত","example":"He is playing music."},{"word":"sport","bangla":"খেলাধুলা","example":"He is watching sport on TV."},{"word":"game","bangla":"খেলা","example":"They are playing a game."},{"word":"book","bangla":"বই","example":"She is reading a good book."},{"word":"paper","bangla":"কাগজ / সংবাদপত্র","example":"He is reading the paper."},{"word":"today","bangla":"আজ","example":"What are you doing today?"},{"word":"time","bangla":"সময়","example":"Now is a good time to practice."},{"word":"morning","bangla":"সকাল","example":"I am working this morning."},{"word":"afternoon","bangla":"বিকেল","example":"She is sleeping this afternoon."},{"word":"evening","bangla":"সন্ধ্যা","example":"What are you doing this evening?"},{"word":"night","bangla":"রাত","example":"I am going out tonight."},{"word":"hot","bangla":"গরম","example":"It is very hot today."},{"word":"cold","bangla":"ঠান্ডা","example":"It is getting cold this evening."},{"word":"happy","bangla":"খুশি","example":"I am feeling very happy today."},{"word":"good","bangla":"ভালো","example":"I am feeling good today."},{"word":"want","bangla":"চাওয়া","example":"What do you want to do now?"},{"word":"need","bangla":"দরকার","example":"I need to finish this now."},{"word":"start","bangla":"শুরু করা","example":"Let us start right now."}]},{"unit":14,"title":"It's time to go!","topic":"Future plans, travel, life changes","grammar":"going to for future plans · Tense review","bangla_notes":"'I am going to study in the UK.' — going to দিয়ে plan বোঝায়। 'She is going to be a doctor.' নিশ্চিত plan এর জন্য going to ব্যবহার করো। বলার সময় সাধারণত 'gonna' বলে: I'm gonna = I'm going to (informal)। Question: 'What are you going to do?'","tracks":9,"vocabulary":[{"word":"plan","bangla":"পরিকল্পনা","example":"What are your plans for next year?"},{"word":"future","bangla":"ভবিষ্যৎ","example":"I am excited about the future."},{"word":"travel","bangla":"ভ্রমণ করা","example":"I am going to travel next month."},{"word":"study","bangla":"পড়াশোনা করা","example":"She is going to study in London."},{"word":"abroad","bangla":"বিদেশে","example":"I want to study abroad."},{"word":"career","bangla":"ক্যারিয়ার / পেশাজীবন","example":"I want a career in medicine."},{"word":"dream","bangla":"স্বপ্ন","example":"My dream is to travel the world."},{"word":"goal","bangla":"লক্ষ্য","example":"My goal is to pass IELTS."},{"word":"education","bangla":"শিক্ষা","example":"I want to continue my education."},{"word":"university","bangla":"বিশ্ববিদ্যালয়","example":"She is going to university in September."},{"word":"college","bangla":"কলেজ","example":"He is starting college next year."},{"word":"course","bangla":"কোর্স","example":"I am going to do an English course."},{"word":"job","bangla":"চাকরি","example":"She is going to apply for a new job."},{"word":"work","bangla":"কাজ","example":"I am going to work harder."},{"word":"money","bangla":"টাকা","example":"I need to save more money."},{"word":"home","bangla":"বাড়ি","example":"I am going to buy a new home."},{"word":"family","bangla":"পরিবার","example":"I want to start a family."},{"word":"friend","bangla":"বন্ধু","example":"I will visit my friend next month."},{"word":"country","bangla":"দেশ","example":"I am going to a new country."},{"word":"city","bangla":"শহর","example":"She is moving to a new city."},{"word":"world","bangla":"পৃথিবী","example":"I want to see the world."},{"word":"move","bangla":"চলে যাওয়া / স্থানান্তর","example":"We are going to move next year."},{"word":"change","bangla":"পরিবর্তন করা","example":"I want to change my life."},{"word":"start","bangla":"শুরু করা","example":"I am going to start a new business."},{"word":"finish","bangla":"শেষ করা","example":"She is going to finish her degree."},{"word":"go","bangla":"যাওয়া","example":"Where are you going to go?"},{"word":"come","bangla":"আসা","example":"She is coming back next year."},{"word":"fly","bangla":"উড়ে যাওয়া","example":"I am going to fly to London."},{"word":"drive","bangla":"গাড়ি চালানো","example":"I am going to learn to drive."},{"word":"build","bangla":"তৈরি করা","example":"They are going to build a new house."},{"word":"learn","bangla":"শেখা","example":"I am going to learn French."},{"word":"teach","bangla":"শেখানো","example":"She wants to teach English."},{"word":"help","bangla":"সাহায্য করা","example":"I want to help other people."},{"word":"achieve","bangla":"অর্জন করা","example":"I will achieve my goals."},{"word":"decide","bangla":"সিদ্ধান্ত নেওয়া","example":"Have you decided what to do?"},{"word":"choose","bangla":"বেছে নেওয়া","example":"Choose your future carefully."},{"word":"try","bangla":"চেষ্টা করা","example":"I am going to try my best."},{"word":"need","bangla":"দরকার","example":"I need to make a plan."},{"word":"want","bangla":"চাওয়া","example":"What do you want to do?"},{"word":"like","bangla":"পছন্দ করা","example":"I would like to travel more."},{"word":"love","bangla":"ভালোবাসা","example":"I love the idea of studying abroad."},{"word":"happy","bangla":"খুশি","example":"I want to be happy in my career."},{"word":"great","bangla":"দারুণ","example":"The future is going to be great."},{"word":"new","bangla":"নতুন","example":"I am ready for a new adventure."},{"word":"important","bangla":"গুরুত্বপূর্ণ","example":"Education is important for my future."},{"word":"possible","bangla":"সম্ভব","example":"Anything is possible if you work hard."},{"word":"difficult","bangla":"কঠিন","example":"It will be difficult but worth it."},{"word":"ready","bangla":"প্রস্তুত","example":"Are you ready for the future?"},{"word":"wonderful","bangla":"অসাধারণ","example":"It will be a wonderful experience."},{"word":"good","bangla":"ভালো","example":"I am going to make good decisions."}]}]}